WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:04.200
Well at night, when we had our mass meetings,

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:11.640
we would take up money that would pay for the gas and the tires and whatever else happened to the cars during the time they were driving them.

3
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:16.020
The people rode free in the day and paid for it at night.
